      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Is that allowed? Can I do it for my book? Does it count? Is it literary juicing? Book viagra? \n\nNewsome! You are a mystery!\n\n\nLibs of TikTok (@libsoftiktok)\n\nBREAKING: Gavin Newsom\u2019s PAC used $1.5 million to buy 67,000 copies of HIS OWN BOOK. Total book sales were around 97,400. His PAC\u2019s purchase accounts for about two-thirds of all sold copies\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/libsoftiktok/status/2044977059819090414#m",
