      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "russell-brand",
      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The \u201clone gunman\u201d bit is the best. How they should team up with the government- they always kill people that benefit them.\n\nIt\u2019s a natural fit.\n\nPlus I\u2019m running for mayor of London in \u201828.\n\n\nTucker Carlson (@TuckerCarlson)\n\nWhen politicians tell you they\u2019re Christians, it makes you wonder if Jesus endorses greed, violence and arrogance. Russell Brand answers that question in his new book, How to Become a Christian in 7 Days.\n\n0:00 Image, Ego, and How the Word Changes You\n13:38 The Forces of Goo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/rustyrockets/status/2045216083414487474",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-17T19:01:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "russell-brand",
      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The mad irony being that the tech that runs @Polymarket could be use to create total democracy right now.\n\n\nPolymarket (@Polymarket)\n\nBREAKING: Democrats projected to seize control of both chambers of Congress this November.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/Polymarket/status/2042264435058684192#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/rustyrockets/status/2045170346366493015",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-17T15:59:42+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "russell-brand",
      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "With all the distractions it\u2019s hard to see the big picture.\n\n\nFurkan G\u00f6z\u00fckara (@FurkanGozukara)\n\nLMAO whoever made this is a genius \ud83d\ude2d\ud83e\udd23\ud83d\ude02\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/FurkanGozukara/status/2044805772421312757#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/rustyrockets/status/2045128002506277136",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-17T13:11:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "russell-brand",
      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We could use @Polymarket tech to make London a \u201creal time, open source\u201d democracy.\n\nDo want police to\nFocus on: A) knife crime B) online crime\u2026\n\nThe tech that\u2019s being used for surveillance and digital idea could be used for Real Democracy.\n\n\nJohn Cleese (@JohnCleese)\n\nDisgraceful\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/JohnCleese/status/2044866102388297777#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/rustyrockets/status/2044923438029017352",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T23:38:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "russell-brand",
      "voiceName": "Russell Brand",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Comedy reveals truth. Spike suffered with mental illness his whole life. He saw how \u201cnormal people\u201d and \u201cnormal rules\u201d were crazy, and laughed.\n\n\nJames Hogg (@JamesAHogg2)\n\nThere are few things on earth as joyous as watching the great Spike Milligan, who was born on this day in 1918, losing it as he recalls his father\u2019s reaction to him cracking one off.\n\nGood day.\n\nVideo\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/JamesAHogg2/status/2044677911945306366#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/rustyrockets/status/2044922332649504968",
      "timestamp": "2026-04-16T23:34:11+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
